  "title": "How Does Financial Data Aggregation Help Underwriting?",
  "summary": "Financial data aggregation helps underwriting by bringing borrower information from multiple sources into one standardized view. Instead of manually collecting bank data, credit reports, accounting records, identity information, and financial documents from separate systems, lenders can aggregate those inputs and use them together to evaluate creditworthiness.",
